-- first_conv_bn_relu_kernel0_real_tile_pkg.vhd
-- VHDL-2008 package of INT8 folded weights, Q.16 fixed-point
-- SCALE_FX/BIAS_FX constants, and Q.16 fixed-point golden output
-- constants for the kernel-0 folded Conv-BN-ReLU design, evaluated on a
-- REAL UAVSAR-tile-derived patch (see real_tile_stimulus_pkg.vhd for the
